.MARINE...
(Today through Wednesday)
Issued at 905 AM PDT Fri Sep 11 2026

A moderate to fresh NW breeze will increase over the next 24
hours, with a strong breeze to develop by early Sunday and
continue into next week. Near gale force to gale force winds are
expected along the inner waters from Pigeon Point to Point Piedras
Blancas, the Monterey Bay, and in portions of the San Francisco
and San Pablo Bays. Hazardous conditions for small craft will
prevail late this weekend through mid next week. Seas are
currently moderate and will build to rough by Monday in response
to the stronger winds.

